# TALMA Media Organizer

Build against [docs/PLAN.md](docs/PLAN.md). One chat per phase; start with "Read docs/PLAN.md, then…".

## Stack

- Laravel (latest), PHP 8 with `declare(strict_types=1);` in every PHP file
- Livewire + Tailwind for UI (not Inertia/Vue)
- Eloquent models and migrations for every database change
- Queued jobs for anything slow (Drive sync, thumbnails, AI tagging)
- Pest for tests
- Secrets only in `.env` / Laravel Cloud env vars — never commit keys or service-account JSON

## Product defaults

- Staff login: Google via Socialite; enforce `@talmaisrael.com` on the server
- All authenticated staff see all media (no folder ACLs in v1)
- Tag taxonomy: English + Hebrew labels (`label_en`, `label_he`)
- Manual tags always win; never overwrite `source = manual` or `status = rejected` on AI re-runs
- Drive service account is Viewer only; do not write descriptions back to Drive in v1
- Any logged-in staff can confirm/reject AI suggestions
- Thumbnails are private; serve via auth-checked URLs or temporary signed URLs

## Coding conventions

- Prefer Artisan commands + jobs over fat controllers for sync/tagging
- Validate AI JSON against the taxonomy before writing `media_tags`
- Prefer `Storage` facade for thumbnails (private S3-compatible disk)
- Schedule Drive change sync with `withoutOverlapping()` and `onOneServer()`
- Keep privacy rules from PLAN.md: no individual identification, no public thumbnail links
